# Dialogue portrait window (#337, D78): carved walnut band 8 px, gilt bead on its inner side, gilt rosettes in the
# corners; nine-patch, insets 12 px. Frame "lit" is the speaker, "dim" the listener: every colour x0.5, the two bright gilts capped (D78).
# The opening is a dusk blue (3d4a68), light enough that the portraits' dark contours read against it (D76 by analogy).
